rchive, Trash or back in the inbox.", "Ask about trains on another day (\"train or drive to the match on Saturday?\", \"any engineering works tomorrow?\") and Navilife says whether it's an office day, your route and TfL's planned works for that morning once it has read them (from 17:00 the evening before). Live train times only show for the next couple of hours."),
