            how = "Choose the time evenings start (e.g. From 19:00) and whether weekends are protected. Work mail: Waits till morning or Shows as it comes.",
            tips = listOf("Tap Not protected tonight to open just this evening (or today, at the weekend); Undo protects it again. Habits and booked sessions still show in protected time. The morning brief and the week ahead say which evenings and days are protected.", "On the morning protected time ends, one note at 07:00 says how many work emails waited and who from (\"3 work emails waited overnight\"); tap it for From your mail. Lower or silence it in Settings → Notifications under \"Work mail that waited\"."),
